 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Oh the depth of the riches and wisdom",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And knowledge of God revealed to us",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His judgments are unsearchable",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His ways remain untraceable",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For from him and through him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And to him are all things",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To him be the glory",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Forever and ever",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who has known the mind of the Lord",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Or who has been his counselor",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who has ever given to him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That he should be repaid",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For from him and through him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And to him are all things",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To him be the glory",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Forever and ever",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He has consigned all to disobedience",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that he may have mercy on all",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mercy shown to you now",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is shown to them as well",
